      "@type": "OverallIntent",
      "instance_name": "overallintent_instance",
      "label": "the overallintent",
      "description": "meme-id: christians_are_bad_drivers; hasOverallIntent: hateful; overall-intent-description: The image juxtaposes a roadside memorial with a school bus in the background, overlaid with the text 'ever notice that christians are bad drivers.' This creates a harmful stereotype by linking religious identity (Christianity) with a negative and dangerous behavior (bad driving), implying that all Christians are inherently reckless or negligent drivers. The visual of a memorial suggests a tragic consequence, which is then falsely attributed to the religious group, making it a hateful meme that targets a specific religious community based on a false and generalized association.",
