      "label": "roadside_memorial_with_school_bus",
      "description": "A roadside memorial (a white wooden cross with floral arrangements) is positioned in the foreground on dry, sandy ground. In the background, a yellow school bus is visible on a road, creating a juxtaposition that implies a tragic event (possibly a school bus accident) and a memorial. The scene is overlaid with text that links the memorial to a stereotype about Christians being bad drivers.",
